snarkjs
-------
snarkjs is declared as an OPTIONAL dependency and is loaded at runtime via a
dynamic import(). It is not bundled with, linked into, or redistributed as
part of this package. Users who choose to install snarkjs obtain it directly
from its authors and are bound by GPL-3.0 in their own right.

Applications that do not generate or verify zero-knowledge proofs need not
install it at all.

circomlib and compiled circuit artifacts
